    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cathal Meares of Sheehy Meares Real Estate is delighted to present this beautifully maintained three-bedroom detached residence at Killahornia, Creagh, Ballinasloe, Co. Roscommon, H53 E634.\n\nPresented in turnkey condition throughout, this attractive home is finished to a high standard and offers comfortable, well-proportioned accommodation. Internally, the property comprises an entrance hallway, two double bedrooms, a single bedroom and a main family bathroom containing a spacious walk in shower area. Two bedrooms benefit from built in storage.\n\nThe living accommodation includes a welcoming sitting room with an open fireplace, together with a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. The kitchen features extensive fitted storage and a quality granite countertop, while a solid-fuel stove with a back boiler provides an additional source of heat and hot water. The property also benefits from oil-fired central heating and a C3 BER rating.\n\nSet on a generous site extending to approximately 0.6 acres, the residence enjoys ample off-street parking and a newly reseeded lawn to the side. A selection of sheds is situated to the rear, providing excellent storage and workshop space. One shed has been converted into a practical utility area with a fitted countertop and sink, together with a separate bathroom featuring a Jacuzzi power bath.\n\nIdeally located in the mature and sought-after Creagh area, the property is approximately five minutes? drive from Ballinasloe town and its wide range of shops, schools, services and amenities.\n\nFor further details or to arrange a viewing, please contact the selling agent."
      },
